  differences = {
    changed = {},
    added = {"Late winter on Routes 22 and 23, Indigo Plateau and Vermilion Dock completes outdoor map coverage.", "Thawing shorelines on Routes 19, 20 and 21 and Cinnabar Island.", "Snow retreats below fence posts and ledges on Routes 13, 14 and 15.", "Late winter in Fuchsia City and on the rooftops and paths in all four outdoor Safari Zone areas.", "Snow along the banks of Cycling Road on Routes 16, 17 and 18.", "Snow at the Underground Path entrances on Routes 7 and 8 and a shrinking rim of snow at the Celadon City pond.", "Snow along the building fronts on Routes 5 and 6 and in Saffron City recedes in February.", "Pier-edge frost on Route 12 and in Vermilion City, and sheltered snow on Route 11.", "Sheltered snow on Routes 9 and 10 and shrinking drifts beside the Pokémon Tower entrance.", "Melting frost along Nugget Bridge and a shrinking snow patch by Bill's garden fence.", "Melting museum icicles in Pewter City and sheltered snow along the rock faces on Routes 3 and 4.", "Late-winter fence frost in Viridian City, grass edges on Route 2 and a sheltered snow patch in Viridian Forest.", "Vermilion City New Year fireworks, reflections, and a confetti greeting.", "January frost and a February thaw. Face the Route 7 chestnut cart in autumn and press A.", "Ten harvest wreaths with wind-blown ribbons on Route 11, Vermilion Dock, Routes 22 and 23, and Indigo Plateau.", "Ten seashell boats with leaf sails on Routes 19, 20 and 21 and at Cinnabar Island.", "Ten autumn chestnut carts with steaming pans on Routes 5 through 8 and in Saffron City.", "Ten leaf drifts respond to bicycles on Routes 16, 17 and 18 and in Celadon City.", "Ten Paras hiding in autumn leaves in Fuchsia City and all four Safari Zone areas.", "Eight harvest baskets with red, golden or green apples on the way to Fuchsia City.", "Six spots with floating red and golden maple leaves beside the piers.", "Eight Gastly flower beds between Cerulean City and Pokémon Tower. Their mist clears as you approach.", "Foraging Pidgey on Routes 24 and 25. AUTUMN MOTION controls their hops and pecking.", "Eight carved pumpkin lanterns on Routes 3 and 4 and in Cerulean City. AUTUMN MOTION animates the candlelight.", "Autumn leaf piles in Pallet Town, on Route 1 and in Viridian City. AUTUMN TEST previews the season year-round. Seven mushroom clusters on Route 2, in Viridian Forest and in Pewter City. AUTUMN MOTION controls leaves and falling acorns.", "Summer sunflowers in Pallet Town, a beach towel and sandals on Route 19, and water glints from Pallet Town along Routes 21, 20 and 19 and around Cinnabar Island. Dragonflies perch on cattails in Fuchsia City and all four outdoor Safari Zone areas. Golden seed heads sway on Routes 15, 14 and 13. Fishing floats and expanding rings appear along Route 12 and in Vermilion City. Eight strings of pennants hang on Routes 6 and 8 and in Saffron City and Lavender Town. Twelve pairs of daisies host blue and amber butterflies on Routes 9, 10, 24 and 25 and in Cerulean City. Paper pinwheels turn beside twelve picnic blankets on Routes 2, 3 and 4, in Viridian Forest and in Pewter and Viridian City. Press A while facing the wheel for three extra turns. Red diamonds, blue swallow kites and orange carp kites rise when a bicycle passes their reels on the way through Celadon and down Cycling Road. Ten fern patches host evening fireflies on Routes 1, 22 and 23 and at Indigo Plateau. They rise as you approach. Five lemonade tables stand on Routes 5 and 11 and at Vermilion Dock. SUMMER MOTION controls the parasols, fireflies, kites, pinwheels, butterfly flight, the flower heads, the pennants, floats and rings, wind, dragonfly flights and water glints", "Drifting petals on all 25 numbered routes, in every Kanto town and city, in Viridian Forest, at Vermilion Dock and in all four Safari Zone areas. Watch for the lilac petals of Lavender Town, the downhill breeze on Cycling Road, floating petals in Celadon and the Safari Zone, and the paired flowers leading to the League at Indigo Plateau", "AUTO (DATE) shows spring from March 1 through May 31, summer from June 1 through August 31 and Christmas from December 1 through January 6", "Spring flowers on all 25 numbered Kanto routes, in Pallet Town, Viridian City, Viridian Forest, Pewter City, Cerulean City, Vermilion City, Vermilion Dock, Lavender Town, Saffron City, Celadon City, Fuchsia City, Cinnabar Island, Indigo Plateau and all four outdoor areas of the Safari Zone", "Date-driven Christmas decorations and snow in Kanto towns, Indigo Plateau, all 25 numbered routes, Viridian Forest, Vermilion Dock and Safari Zone", "Solid tree bases and A-button Christmas greetings", "Snow/frost on live trees, Cut bushes and tall grass", "Snow on stones, native fence tops and plateau tops; snowy Cerulean bridge and Vermilion dock decks"},
